<h1 data-copy-en="Katie" data-copy-zh="Katie">Katie</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Tutorial order, dates, work requirements and personal visits." data-copy-zh="教学顺序、约会、工作要求与个人探访。">Tutorial order, dates, work requirements and personal visits.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Character_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Night_Club_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Be_With_Katie_Branches"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Katie.27s_First_Confession_and_Private_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Katie's_First_Confession_and_Private_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Late_Night_Relaxing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Family_Photo"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Seven_One-Time_Home_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk.2C_Chocolate_and_General_Suggestions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk,_Chocolate_and_General_Suggestions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Tutorial_Best_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Tutorial_Chain_and_Unlocks"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Katie — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/katie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Katie — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/katie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Katie — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Katie’s route doubles as the early tutorial. If gifts, dates or later conversations are missing, follow the job-and-gift tutorial chain before raising more affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Katie's Home</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Family_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Complete Diane’s Responsibility lesson, return to Katie, meet Joey at the Convenience Store, then earn 3 Work Experience and revisit Katie. This opens the relationship-growth tutorial and the early gifts/dates.</p><p>For the later tutorial: Friend (100), Zoo Date and Family Photo come before the school-hall Rachel visit; next visit the cafe with Emily at Friend (100). The evening at Katie’s home starts at 20:00–22:00 with Dating Outfit level 2 and advances 180 minutes.</p><p>Her first confession needs the evening tutorial and Crush (400). It opens two separate daily private options with different time and Energy costs. Neither is an extra named relationship stage.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Something Sweeter</th><td data-label="Requirements">Food Court (Mall); 14:00–18:00; Katie Friend (100); Torea Friend (100); Story 61</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kindred Pages</th><td data-label="Requirements">City Library (Uptown); 10:00–17:00; Katie Friend (100); Bella Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Service With a Sneer</th><td data-label="Requirements">Food Court (Mall); 09:00–14:00; Katie Friend (100); Miki Friend (100); The Food Court Gauntlet</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Two Walks, One Path</th><td data-label="Requirements">Uptown Park; 13:00–16:00; Katie Friend (100); Mindy Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Family Matters</th><td data-label="Requirements">Town Hall Office; 09:00–17:00; Katie Explains Jobs and Gifts; Welcome to Town Hall</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +2; Diane +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie's First Confession</th><td data-label="Requirements">Katie's Home; Katie Crush (400); KTV Evening with Katie and Emily</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie Explains What She Likes</th><td data-label="Requirements">Katie's Home; Katie Comes Over</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie Explains Jobs and Gifts</th><td data-label="Requirements">Katie's Home; Diane’s Responsibility lesson</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Joey Puts You to Work</th><td data-label="Requirements">Corner Convenience Store; Katie Explains Jobs and Gifts</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie Explains Growing Relationships</th><td data-label="Requirements">Katie's Home; Joey Puts You to Work; Work Experience 3</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie Explains People</th><td data-label="Requirements">Katie's Home; Katie Friend (100); Katie Explains Growing Relationships; Zoo Date with Katie; Katie: Family Photo</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie Meets Rachel</th><td data-label="Requirements">University Hall; 09:00–17:00; Katie Explains People</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie Meets Emily</th><td data-label="Requirements">Local Café (Interior); 07:00–15:00; Emily Friend (100); Katie Meets Rachel</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +3; Emily +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">KTV Evening with Katie and Emily</th><td data-label="Requirements">Katie's Home; 20:00–22:00; Katie Meets Emily; Dating Outfit level 2</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Katie +8; Emily +8</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Katie</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 7/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Known (25); Katie Explains Growing Relationships</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+4 base affection; 8/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">General Suggestions</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Katie Explains Growing Relationships</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Family Photo</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Friend (100); Katie Explains Growing Relationships; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Late Night Relaxing</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Close Friend (200); Katie Explains Growing Relationships; Family Photo; 21:00–24:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Time with Katie</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Crush (400); Katie's First Confession; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+40 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Be With Katie</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Crush (400); Katie's First Confession; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Comiccon Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Katie Explains Growing Relationships; 10:00–16:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; $150; −60 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Farmers Market Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Katie Explains Growing Relationships; 08:00–13:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; $40; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Picnic Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Katie Explains Growing Relationships; 11:00–16:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $30; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stargazing Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Katie Explains Growing Relationships; 21:00–24:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoo Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Katie Explains Growing Relationships; 09:00–16:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Katie Explains Growing Relationships; 13:00–15:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $150; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Katie's Home; Friend (100); 12:00–18:00; unavailable during pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; 1 Voucher</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>The six early dates each have their own one-time completion and start window. The Voucher prize date is a separate Friend (100) activity that consumes one Voucher.</p><p>The optional pregnancy route adds Check In and later Family Check In: 30 minutes, once per day, +5 direct affection. Talk, Chocolate and General Suggestions remain available while several dates, H2Hs and private activities pause under the showing-pregnancy restriction. See <a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy</a>.</p><p>The opening tutorial supplies 1 Crystal once. The later KTV evening advances 180 minutes.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before other bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount.</p><p>Stamina 20; Intelligence 20; Charm 20</p><p>Favorite skill: Responsibility</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection and NPC intimacy experience are distinct. Dialogue choices can add rewards beyond the listed event-completion base.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Work Experience 3 is the tutorial check; simply waiting or earning money elsewhere does not meet it.</li><li>Check the school, cafe and home destinations in order. The tutorial does not all happen in one room.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-diane.html">Diane</a></li><li><a href="character-joey.html">Joey</a></li><li><a href="character-emily.html">Emily</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Location reference</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story navigation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Character_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Night_Club_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Be_With_Katie_Branches"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Katie.27s_First_Confession_and_Private_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Katie's_First_Confession_and_Private_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Late_Night_Relaxing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Family_Photo"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Seven_One-Time_Home_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk.2C_Chocolate_and_General_Suggestions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk,_Chocolate_and_General_Suggestions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Tutorial_Best_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Tutorial_Chain_and_Unlocks"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Katie 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/katie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Katie 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/katie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Katie 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Katie 的路线也承担前期教学。送礼、约会或后续谈话没有出现时，请先推进工作与礼物教学链，再继续提升好感度。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Katie 的家</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Family_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>完成 Diane 的责任感课程后回访 Katie，再到便利店见 Joey，取得 3 工作经验后回到 Katie 家。这会开启关系成长教学，以及前期送礼和约会。</p><p>后续教学要求先达到朋友（100），完成动物园约会及家庭照片，再到学校走廊触发 Rachel 的探访；之后在 Emily 达到朋友（100）时到咖啡馆。Katie 家的晚间节点要求 20:00–22:00 与约会装 2 级，事件会经过 180 分钟。</p><p>首次告白要求完成晚间教学，并达到迷恋（400），随后开放两项分别计算每日次数的私人行动，耗时与精力消耗不同。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">更甜美的东西</th><td data-label="条件">美食广场（商场）; 14:00–18:00; Katie 朋友 (100); Torea 朋友 (100); 主线 61</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">书页知音</th><td data-label="条件">城市图书馆（上城区）; 10:00–17:00; Katie 朋友 (100); Bella 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">冷笑相迎的服务</th><td data-label="条件">美食广场（商场）; 09:00–14:00; Katie 朋友 (100); Miki 朋友 (100); 美食广场考验</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">两段散步，一条小径</th><td data-label="条件">上城公园; 13:00–16:00; Katie 朋友 (100); Mindy 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">家务事</th><td data-label="条件">市政厅办公室; 09:00–17:00; Katie 给你讲讲工作和礼物; 欢迎来到市政厅</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +2; Diane +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie 的初次坦白</th><td data-label="条件">Katie 的家; Katie 迷恋 (400); 和 Katie、Emily 的 KTV 之夜</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie 给你讲讲她喜欢什么</th><td data-label="条件">Katie 的家; Katie 登门拜访</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie 给你讲讲工作和礼物</th><td data-label="条件">Katie 的家; Diane 的责任感课程</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Joey 给你派活儿</th><td data-label="条件">街角便利店; Katie 给你讲讲工作和礼物</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系</th><td data-label="条件">Katie 的家; Joey 给你派活儿; 工作经验 3</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie 给你讲讲人际</th><td data-label="条件">Katie 的家; Katie 朋友 (100); Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 和 Katie 的动物园约会; Katie: 家庭照片</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie 结识 Rachel</th><td data-label="条件">大学大厅; 09:00–17:00; Katie 给你讲讲人际</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Katie 结识 Emily</th><td data-label="条件">本地咖啡馆（内部）; 07:00–15:00; Emily 朋友 (100); Katie 结识 Rachel</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +3; Emily +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Katie、Emily 的 KTV 之夜</th><td data-label="条件">Katie 的家; 20:00–22:00; Katie 结识 Emily; 约会装等级 2</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Katie +8; Emily +8</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Katie 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 7次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; 已知 (25); Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 巧克力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+4 基础好感度; 8次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一般建议</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">家庭照片</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; 朋友 (100); Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">深夜放松</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; 亲密朋友 (200); Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 家庭照片; 21:00–24:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Katie 的私密时光</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; 迷恋 (400); Katie 的初次坦白; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+40 基础好感度; 1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">陪伴 Katie</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; 迷恋 (400); Katie 的初次坦白; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −45 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动漫展约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 10:00–16:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180 分钟; $150; −60 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">农贸市场约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 08:00–13:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; $40; −30 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">野餐约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 11:00–16:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $30; −40 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">观星约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 21:00–24:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −40 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动物园约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 09:00–16:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $100; −50 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游园会约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; Katie 给你讲讲如何增进关系; 13:00–15:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $150; −45 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Katie 的家; 朋友 (100); 12:00–18:00; 孕期不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; 1 兑换券</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>六项前期约会各自只完成一次，开始时段也不同。兑换券奖品约会是独立的朋友（100）行动，会消耗 1 兑换券。</p><p>可选孕期路线还会增加关心近况及后续的陪伴家人：30 分钟、每天一次，直接增加 5 好感度。显怀限制生效期间，交谈、巧克力与一般建议仍可进行，部分约会、谈心与私人行动会暂停。详见<a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">孕期系统</a>.</p><p>开场教学会给予 1 水晶，仅一次。后续 KTV 晚间事件会经过 180 分钟。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。</p><p>耐力 20; 智力 20; 魅力 20</p><p>偏好技能：责任感</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择还可能在事件完成基础奖励之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>教学检查的是 3 工作经验，单纯等待或通过其他方式赚钱不能代替。</li><li>请依次检查学校、咖啡馆与家中的节点，教学并非全部发生在同一个房间。</li></ul></section>
